  <li><a id="n5"></a>See <a href="https://www.newyorkfed.org/newsevents/speeches/2021/log210811" target="_blank">&ldquo;Liquidity Shocks: Lessons Learned from the Global Financial Crisis  and the Pandemic,&rdquo;</a> by Lorie K. Logan, remarks at the 2021 Financial Crisis Forum, Panel on Lessons  for Emergency Lending, Federal Reserve Bank of New York, Aug. 11, 2021.</li>
  <li><a id="n6"></a>See <a href="/news/speeches/logan/2023/lkl230303" target="_blank">&ldquo;Preventing and responding to dysfunction in core markets,&rdquo;</a> by Lorie K.  Logan, remarks at the Workshop on Market Dysfunction at the University of  Chicago Booth School of Business, Federal Reserve Bank of Dallas, March 3,  2023.</li>
